{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 4958062,
  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34676042",
      "title": "Sessions & Cookies - Preparation",
      "lectureOrder": 95,
      "videoOrder": 88,
      "sourceHash": "7dd17622b7135ed0667756c1c6c2682c463183b4513e4f95fecea5b5e2e490c1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 5.46,
          "en": "So it's time for some cookies, some session cookies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.46,
          "end": 9,
          "en": "And for that I'll stay in the auth.server.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 9,
          "end": 11.88,
          "en": "And in there we got a couple of things to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.88,
          "end": 16.88,
          "en": "First, we should import something from @remix-run/node.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.22,
          "end": 20.22,
          "en": "And that something is a function called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 20.22,
          "end": 21.413,
          "en": "createCookieSessionStorage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.61,
          "end": 26.31,
          "en": "Now as the name kind of implies, this will help us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.31,
          "end": 28.74,
          "en": "create cookie-based sessions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.74,
          "end": 33,
          "en": "And with that function imported, right below the imports,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33,
          "end": 36.87,
          "en": "not inside a separate function, I will add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.87,
          "end": 40.08,
          "en": "a session storage constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.08,
          "end": 43.95,
          "en": "where I call the createCookieSessionStorage function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.95,
          "end": 45.81,
          "en": "we just imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.81,
          "end": 49.59,
          "en": "To that function, we pass an object, a configuration object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.59,
          "end": 53.97,
          "en": "where we set the cookie key to yet another nested object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.97,
          "end": 55.86,
          "en": "on which we then configure this cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.86,
          "end": 59.583,
          "en": "that will be sent back to our users and to their browsers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.51,
          "end": 62.25,
          "en": "And here if, we wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.25,
          "end": 66.24,
          "en": "that it generally is using https",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.24,
          "end": 70.77,
          "en": "so that it's only working over an https environment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.77,
          "end": 74.03999999999999,
          "en": "But during development, I actually wanna disable this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 74.03999999999999,
          "end": 78.87,
          "en": "because the development server is not using https.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.87,
          "end": 81.45,
          "en": "And therefore we can use process.env",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.45,
          "end": 84.24,
          "en": "to access Node.js environment variables.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.24,
          "end": 88.44,
          "en": "So this is not a Remix feature, but a Node.js feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.44,
          "end": 90.99,
          "en": "And there we're interested in the special",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.99,
          "end": 95.85,
          "en": "NODE_ENV variable which is set automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 95.85,
          "end": 99.39,
          "en": "We wanna check if that is equal to production.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 99.39,
          "end": 101.61,
          "en": "If it is, then we'll set this to true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.61,
          "end": 105.50999999999999,
          "en": "So we'll enforce https cookies, otherwise we won't.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 105.50999999999999,
          "end": 108.84,
          "en": "And during development this will be set automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 108.84,
          "end": 111.06,
          "en": "Thereafter, when we deploy the application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111.06,
          "end": 113.19,
          "en": "it's typically also set automatically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 113.19,
          "end": 114.99000000000001,
          "en": "depending on which host you choose.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.99000000000001,
          "end": 117.06,
          "en": "Otherwise you have to set this environment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.06,
          "end": 119.07,
          "en": "variable manually there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 119.07,
          "end": 121.983,
          "en": "But I'll get back to deployment in a separate section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.21,
          "end": 125.04,
          "en": "So that's the first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 125.04,
          "end": 128.52,
          "en": "The next step is that we add a secrets option",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 128.52,
          "end": 131.16,
          "en": "to this cookie option, to this cookie setting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.16,
          "end": 133.8,
          "en": "And that's an array of secret keys",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.8,
          "end": 136.07999999999998,
          "en": "that will be used for assigning these cookies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.07999999999998,
          "end": 137.67000000000002,
          "en": "And that's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.67000000000002,
          "end": 140.7,
          "en": "In the end, the only thing that makes a session cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.7,
          "end": 144.87,
          "en": "a useful session cookie is the fact that only the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.87,
          "end": 147.06,
          "en": "only the back backend code can tell",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.06,
          "end": 151.35,
          "en": "whether that session cookie was generated by it or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.35,
          "end": 153.66,
          "en": "Because, of course the front end could send",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.66,
          "end": 157.17000000000002,
          "en": "any cookie attached to incoming requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.17000000000002,
          "end": 160.56,
          "en": "In order to tell that it's a valid cookie, we must sign it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.56,
          "end": 164.31,
          "en": "with some key that's only known by the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 164.31,
          "end": 167.67000000000002,
          "en": "And for that I'll add a special environment variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 167.67000000000002,
          "end": 170.16,
          "en": "to this .env file, which allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 170.16,
          "end": 173.4,
          "en": "to set environment variables during development.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.4,
          "end": 175.62,
          "en": "And I'll add an environment variable called",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 175.62,
          "end": 176.453,
          "en": "SESSION_SECRET.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 178.77,
          "end": 181.05,
          "en": "The value to which I set it, will just be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.05,
          "end": 185.19,
          "en": "'supersecret' like this, but it can be any value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 185.19,
          "end": 186.9,
          "en": "And of course for production it should be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.9,
          "end": 188.88,
          "en": "a more secure value than that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.88,
          "end": 190.743,
          "en": "But this is for development here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.12,
          "end": 196.14,
          "en": "With that set back in the auth.server.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.14,
          "end": 198.69,
          "en": "I'll add a new constant here, called SESSION_SECRET",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 200.85,
          "end": 204.09,
          "en": "which is an equal to process.env.,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.09,
          "end": 209.09,
          "en": "and then I use that key which I just added in my .env file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.13,
          "end": 211.47,
          "en": "So now we set our own environment variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.47,
          "end": 214.41,
          "en": "for development here, and I'm storing the value stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 214.41,
          "end": 216.747,
          "en": "in that environment variable in this constant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.747,
          "end": 219.6,
          "en": "And I'm using this constant down here then.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 219.6,
          "end": 222.6,
          "en": "And with that, I set my SECRET with which my cookies",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.6,
          "end": 225.42000000000002,
          "en": "will be signed to that secret that's stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 225.42000000000002,
          "end": 227.46,
          "en": "in this .env file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.46,
          "end": 229.8,
          "en": "And it will not be exposed to the front end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.8,
          "end": 231.4,
          "en": "And that's, of course important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 232.65,
          "end": 234.66,
          "en": "Next, we add the same site setting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 234.66,
          "end": 236.76,
          "en": "and set this to 'lax' to add some protection",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.76,
          "end": 239.79,
          "en": "against potential attacks where malicious requests",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 239.79,
          "end": 243.12,
          "en": "from third party sites could lead our users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.12,
          "end": 246.54,
          "en": "to make requests they don't wanna make, basically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 246.54,
          "end": 249.333,
          "en": "sameSite \"lax\" helps us protect against that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 250.35,
          "end": 252.57,
          "en": "And we add a maxAge to the cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.57,
          "end": 255.28,
          "en": "And here I'll essentially set it to 30 days",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.17,
          "end": 260.013,
          "en": "by calculating the time span in seconds like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.91,
          "end": 262.62,
          "en": "So this is set to a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.62,
          "end": 265.863,
          "en": "in seconds that reflects 30 days here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 267.03,
          "end": 268.41,
          "en": "And now last but not least",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 268.41,
          "end": 272.04,
          "en": "the last setting that should be added here is httpOnly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 272.04,
          "end": 273.96,
          "en": "which is set to true to ensure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 273.96,
          "end": 278.34000000000003,
          "en": "that client site JavaScript code can't access this cookie.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 278.34000000000003,
          "end": 280.81,
          "en": "With that, we're generating a secure cookie",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 280.81,
          "end": 285.12,
          "en": "where we set up a storage that will give us secure cookies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 285.12,
          "end": 287.67,
          "en": "And with that we have an important prerequisite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 287.67,
          "end": 288.503,
          "en": "out of the way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 288.503,
          "end": 290.823,
          "en": "Now we can start creating such cookies.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
